Subject: [PATCH] pinctrl: mstar: MSC313/SSD20xD and PM pin controllers

The SoC and PM pin controllers of the MStar/SigmaStar Armv7 SoCs, with the SSD20xD pin tables.

Origin: https://github.com/linux-chenxing/linux.git mstar_v6_5_rebase 5de660288cdf709dd40882bc57170f81ab744dea
